{"meta":{"id":"tt10946316","type":"series","name":"El instituto","imdb_id":"tt10946316","description":"Luke Ellis, un genio de 14 años, es secuestrado en plena noche y trasladado al Instituto, una instalación en el Maine rural que recluye a niños con habilidades psíquicas. Su directora es la Sra. Sigsby, una sádica y firme defensora de la causa que hará cualquier cosa para llevar a cabo su misión. Sigsby y Luke chocan de inmediato en un letal enfrentamiento de opiniones.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt10946316.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wWleS7DxsoGCkOPisNf8OZ2udiD.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/55sfrCHp0WHxLYtcybFjNnm1qWk.png","genres":["Misterio","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"releaseInfo":"2025-","released":"2025-07-13T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","runtime":"58 min","imdbRating":"6.7","country":"United States of America","cast":["Ben Barnes","Joe Freeman","Simone Miller","Fionn Laird","Hannah Galway","Robert Joy","Mary-Louise Parker"],"writer":["Benjamin Cavell"],"trailers":[{"source":"1BcvAdfyL5Y","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"1BcvAdfyL5Y","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"1BcvAdfyL5Y","title":"Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"6.7","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt10946316"},{"name":"Misterio","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Misterio"},{"name":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Sci-Fi+%26+Fantasy"},{"name":"Ben Barnes","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Ben%20Barnes"},{"name":"Joe Freeman","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Joe%20Freeman"},{"name":"Simone Miller","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Simone%20Miller"},{"name":"Fionn Laird","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Fionn%20Laird"},{"name":"Hannah Galway","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Hannah%20Galway"},{"name":"Robert Joy","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Robert%20Joy"},{"name":"Mary-Louise Parker","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Mary-Louise%20Parker"},{"name":"Benjamin Cavell","category":"Writers","url":"stremio:///search?search=Benjamin%20Cavell"}],"app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Ben Barnes","character":"Tim Jamieson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/k0tAM9XK0s4n0VQq1jX5cGf9uAa.jpg","tmdbId":25130},{"name":"Joe Freeman","character":"Luke Ellis","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/z0AzrUstVOkw2wDanWtTFAvzvY2.jpg","tmdbId":3224159},{"name":"Simone Miller","character":"Kalisha","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/IK00CWfqxWGPo71Nsy3aBcVs0Z.jpg","tmdbId":4910530},{"name":"Fionn Laird","character":"Nick Wilholm","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/rkXhob9jRnLsFJk04qSKi4og2rN.jpg","tmdbId":4958994},{"name":"Hannah Galway","character":"Wendy Gullickson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/5vEWCUQAs7KHfNcarcUN810jwdE.jpg","tmdbId":2997200},{"name":"Robert Joy","character":"Hendricks","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/kPY9ggs4qCi3oeEvkYP17Yvfm5r.jpg","tmdbId":19976},{"name":"Mary-Louise Parker","character":"Ms. Sigsby","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/1ohhrIZ4OMlLx9DvHjPhQJAIP0F.jpg","tmdbId":18248}],"writers":[{"name":"Benjamin Cavell","character":"Benjamin Cavell","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/rumaFod7gzuOZbkQh9oYbtShPZc.jpg","tmdbId":1291030}],"certification":"TV-MA","seasonPosters":["https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuJzSRiz3zEbxeRie4ldgkKMm8l.jpg","https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MwXkOAMd9ObxdacasPFM32n9dZ.jpg"]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt10946316:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"The Boy","overview":"Luke Ellis wakes up at The Institute, a facility that abducts teenagers with psychic powers. Ms. Sigsby, the place's charismatic director, claims they're saving the world. Meanwhile, Tim Jamieson hides from his haunted past as a small-town night knocker.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fK9XYdRf4Mi0QkTu27prFX8FsM9.jpg","released":"2025-07-13T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"59 min"},{"id":"tt10946316:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Shots for Dots","overview":"Luke bonds with the other Front Half residents, begins plotting his escape. Meanwhile, Ms. Sigsby manages the fallout from a security breach. In town, Tim begins to look into The Institute, only to find himself caught up in a high-stakes standoff.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AeDoiKdHLnb28l3KlGbvxpsfopt.jpg","released":"2025-07-13T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"54 min"},{"id":"tt10946316:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Graduation","overview":"Luke begins to plan his escape while Sigsby is distracted trying to expose Stackhouse's disloyalty. Meanwhile, Tim loses a friend.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pVbVnDGgVdzCKh9nk11lrPmV6ub.jpg","released":"2025-07-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt10946316:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"The Box","overview":"As Luke's tests intensify, a new arrival causes problems for Sigsby; Tim isn't buying the official story about what happened to Annie.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oFWupSztTMWLKz0X7LYxXqeEvCd.jpg","released":"2025-07-27T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"56 min"},{"id":"tt10946316:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Back Half","overview":"Sigsby tricks Luke into confirming he's TP, forcing him to move up his escape attempt; Tim's suspicions put him on the Institute's radar.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7rGQiitQaAo5jN8RE7I53g0aOx1.jpg","released":"2025-08-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"59 min"},{"id":"tt10946316:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Run","overview":"As Tim's investigation pays off in ways he never imagined and Sigsby scrambles to avert disaster, Luke must finally decide who he can trust.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kVaQBymWG7fTV26TG0uTLAx3E8b.jpg","released":"2025-08-10T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt10946316:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Hide","overview":"Luke and Tim go on a desperate search for help as Sigsby uses all of her formidable assets in a last-ditch attempt to keep the Institute's secrets.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xSu4z6mNLRkz5nQYPaySjQucuDL.jpg","released":"2025-08-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt10946316:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Fight","overview":"Our characters come together for a final confrontation with unimaginable consequences.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/78DIglCLtKRukzt1JXKz96d3d2M.jpg","released":"2025-08-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"49 min"},{"id":"tt10946316:2:1","season":2,"episode":1,"title":"The Reckoning","overview":"In the wake of their climactic escape from Dennison, our crew searches for a way to end the Institute for good. The Director enlists a new ally to help him rebuild. Sigsby’s life as a fugitive pushes her to seek a way back “in.” Luke's power grows.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4bOFNHpSENLukOUZqbPP1Rw0Zue.jpg","released":"2026-11-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"61 min"},{"id":"tt10946316:2:2","season":2,"episode":2,"title":"The Sanctuary","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1St7wjGPhO3E9YOpN590GVPzUMf.jpg","released":"2026-11-15T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt10946316:2:3","season":2,"episode":3,"title":"Double Cross","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2kg8OtdYVPUVvPhU99r5gONGI7e.jpg","released":"2026-11-22T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt10946316:2:4","season":2,"episode":4,"title":"Truth and Consequences","released":"2026-11-29T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt10946316:2:5","season":2,"episode":5,"title":"The Scraper","released":"2026-12-06T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt10946316:2:6","season":2,"episode":6,"title":"Hinge","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wUAhwOs81q7UwHQvF1DdFmiF74X.jpg","released":"2026-12-13T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt10946316:2:7","season":2,"episode":7,"title":"Break On Through","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i7zPI1Tf7ORfOKG2XX9ch97EYwO.jpg","released":"2026-12-20T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt10946316:2:8","season":2,"episode":8,"title":"The Other Side","released":"2026-12-27T12:00:00.000Z"}]}}